{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Secure Document Vault 是一款主打完全離線的文件掃描與管理工具，適合專業人士、學生以及重視私隱的用家。無論是整理收據、保存合約或管理個人文件，所有資料都只留在自己的裝置上，不會上傳雲端。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，可在 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>離線掃描與智能整理</h2>\n<p>這款 App 提供專業級掃描效果，能將紙本文件轉成清晰電子檔，亦支援從多個來源匯入文件。內置智能整理與儲存系統，配合強大的搜尋與檢視功能，讓你隨時找回所需檔案。所有資料只存放於裝置本機，並提供安全的本機備份與還原，全程沒有雲端連線與數據收集，私隱由自己掌握。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-116-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-117-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-118-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-119-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-120-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-121-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Secure Document Vault</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T21:38:03.464528+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":335,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}